{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardinal Descent is a card building roguelike where you craft elemental synergies and find game breaking sticker combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically play element based cards to pull off combos of your choosing. Play your cards in the right order to maximise damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/elements.gif?t=1749125784\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Change the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress you unlock game changing stickers that are placed on your cards, find cool synergies and combos as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/stickers.gif?t=1749125784\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Break The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sticker editing and the shop allow you to craft the perfect synergy to deal insane amounts of damage. Will you break the game? Or will it outpace you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/combo.gif?t=1749125784\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114100?t=1749125784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/ced9328419a73f0f6c0aa6786f1f70ce3a379be1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749125784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/6bc64e00039016e676dd3dfd97946c9d57777a32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749125784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/6bc64e00039016e676dd3dfd97946c9d57777a32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749125784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"